<div class="c8 c17 mezon-discord">
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0" style="font-size: 20px;"><br>&#128640; &#119820;&#119812;&#119833;&#119822;&#119821; &ndash;
            &#119827;&#119815;&#119812; &#119808;&#119819;&#119819;-&#119816;&#119821;-&#119822;&#119821;&#119812;
            &#119826;&#119822;&#119819;&#119828;&#119827;&#119816;&#119822;&#119821; &#119813;&#119822;&#119825;
            &#119810;&#119822;&#119820;&#119820;&#119828;&#119821;&#119816;&#119827;&#119816;&#119812;&#119826; &amp;
            &#119809;&#119828;&#119826;&#119816;&#119821;&#119812;&#119826;&#119826;&#119812;&#119826;&#128640;<br>
            </span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord is a popular communication platform, but when it comes to information management, enterprise
            operations, and deep tool integration, Discord still has many limitations.<br> Mezon was created to fill
            that gap &ndash; a powerful, optimized, and modern platform designed to meet all your community connection
            and management needs.</span></p>
    <p class="c6" id="h.qrsp56wisndv"><span class="c11 c10">1&#65039;&#8419; Professional Organization &ndash; Seamless
            Communication</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord offers text, voice, and video channels, screen sharing, basic role
            management, and third-party bots. However, managing large communities can often feel fragmented and
            disconnected from actual workflows.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c2">Mezon retains all of Discord&rsquo;s features but adds three core pillars:
            Workstation &ndash; Ecosystem &ndash; AI Agent, allowing centralized management, detailed role permissions,
            and stronger connections between members and their work &ndash; true to the spirit of </span><span
            class="c2 c16">&ldquo;Play together &ndash; Work better&rdquo;</span><span class="c0">.</span></p>
    <p class="c6" id="h.nf3bjl7fzvva"><span class="c11 c10">2&#65039;&#8419; Token Ecosystem &ndash; Turning
            Interaction into Real Value</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord does not support Tokens, while Mezon integrates a Token system directly into
            the platform. This allows communities to reward contributions, manage activities, and drive engagement
            without third-party tools &ndash; all optimized within Mezon.</span></p>
    <p class="c6" id="h.trqkfswlx089"><span class="c10 c11">3&#65039;&#8419; Flexible Customization &amp; Automation
            &ndash; No Nitro Required</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Mezon provides a visual GUI for bots, allowing users to easily interact through forms
            like Daily Form, Unlock Form, and Voucher Form.<br> It also supports Flow Code, enabling drag-and-drop bot
            creation and workflow automation without coding.<br> All of Discord&rsquo;s features are included, but Mezon
            is faster, smoother, and easier to scale &ndash; making it especially ideal for businesses.</span></p>
    <p class="c6" id="h.i5mubw2ymase"><span class="c11 c10">4&#65039;&#8419; Proven by Real Businesses</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Mezon has been deployed internally at NCC with over 350 accounts, proving its
            exceptional effectiveness in community management, corporate culture building, and member engagement.</span>
    </p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">&#128073; If you&rsquo;re looking for a centralized platform with strong engagement,
            easy management, and unlimited scalability, Mezon is the ultimate choice!</span></p>
    <br>
    <p class="c5" id="h.xepnv7kf7hy2"><span class="c11 c3">1&#65039;&#8419; Professional Organization &ndash; Seamless
            Communication</span></p>
    <p class="c4 c8" id="h.lnqiiwd6jrob"><span class="c0 c8">Discord stands out for its ability to create multiple
            text, voice, and video channels, support topic-based groups, and provide basic role management (admin,
            moderator, member). It also offers automatic voice channels, screen sharing, video calls, and supports
            third-party bots for community management or mini-games. However, as communities or businesses grow,
            information management can become fragmented, role permissions remain limited, and data is easily dispersed.
            Discord is primarily suited for entertainment-driven communities or small groups.</span></p>
    <p class="c4 c8" id="h.lnqiiwd6jrob-1"><span class="c2 c3">In contrast, Mezon includes all of Discord&rsquo;s
            features (text, voice, video, screen sharing, topic channels, roles, bots&hellip;) but is purpose-built for
            large communities and businesses. Built on three core pillars: Workstation &ndash; Ecosystem &ndash; AI
            Agent, Mezon seamlessly connects communication with task management, provides detailed permissions by group,
            project, and role, and centralizes all data into a unified system. This makes discussions, task assignments,
            and progress tracking clear and efficient. With the motto </span><span class="c2 c3 c16">&ldquo;Play
            together &ndash; Work better&rdquo;</span><span class="c0 c8">, Mezon fosters stronger connections among
            members while enhancing operational efficiency for organizations and communities.</span></p>
    <p class="c4 c8" id="h.vqblkanyut1g"><span class="c2 c3">&#128073; Discord excels at basic communication, but Mezon
            goes further by integrating all its features with a professional management system &ndash; enabling
            organizations to grow sustainably and operate more effectively.</span></p>
    <p class="c14 c9"><span class="c7"></span></p>

    <img src="https://mezon.ai/blogs/assets/images/token-view.png" alt="token-view" style="object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;"/>

    <p class="c6" id="h.n2s8fgbcx4ey"><span class="c11 c10">2&#65039;&#8419; Token Ecosystem &ndash; Turning
            Interaction into Real Value</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord does not integrate a Token mechanism into its platform. As a result,
            activities such as rewarding members, gamification, or building engagement must rely on third-party tools.
            This makes management more complex, data more fragmented, and harder to control as the community or business
            grows. Interactions on Discord therefore often stop at simple &ldquo;back-and-forth communication,&rdquo;
            offering little long-term value for participants.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c2">In contrast, </span><span class="c13">Mezon integrates a complete Token ecosystem
            directly into the platform</span><span class="c0">, allowing communities and businesses to reward
            contributions, track engagement, and manage activities through a single unified system. Tokens can be used
            to unlock privileges, upgrade member levels, or be redeemed for real rewards, turning every interaction into
            motivation. Without the need for external tools, organizations can easily design policies that foster
            long-term member loyalty and increase community engagement.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c2">&#128073; Discord only facilitates communication, while Mezon </span><span
            class="c13">turns interaction into real value</span><span class="c0">, enabling communities and businesses
            to manage more effectively and drive sustainable growth.</span></p>
    <p class="c9 c14"><span class="c0"></span></p>

    <img src="https://mezon.ai/blogs/assets/images/dynamic-api.png" alt="dynamic-api.png" style="object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px;"/>

    <p class="c6" id="h.afe318dvdvqp"><span class="c11 c10">3&#65039;&#8419; Flexible Customization &amp; Automation
            &ndash; No Nitro Required</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord offers a powerful bot system, but it primarily operates through text commands
            and heavily depends on third-party developers. Customizing bots to meet specific needs is often complex,
            requires coding skills, and upgrading advanced features usually requires purchasing Nitro. This makes it
            difficult for businesses or large communities to automate workflows and often leaves them reliant on
            multiple external tools.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c2">In contrast, </span><span class="c13">Mezon provides an intuitive GUI for
            bots</span><span class="c2">, allowing users to easily interact through forms such as Daily Form, Unlock
            Form, and Voucher Form without the need for complicated commands. More importantly, Mezon supports
        </span><span class="c13">Flow Code &ndash; a drag-and-drop system to create bots and automate workflows without
            coding</span><span class="c0">, enabling businesses to build tailored systems independently. With deep
            customization, fast performance, and easy scalability, Mezon is ideal for communities and organizations that
            require professional operations.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c2">&#128073; If Discord is only strong in basic bots and disconnected from enterprise
            operations, </span><span class="c11 c10">Mezon delivers a fully automated platform, easy to customize, and
            free from third-party dependencies.</span></p>
    <p class="c4 c9"><span class="c11 c10"></span></p>
    <p class="c6" id="h.gfj1mlgv4df8"><span class="c11 c10">4&#65039;&#8419; Proven by Real Businesses</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">Discord is a popular platform used by many communities; however, it primarily serves
            communication and entertainment needs. Applying Discord in a corporate environment often faces challenges
            due to the lack of comprehensive management tools, fragmented data, and difficulty in fostering long-term
            member engagement. As a result, Discord rarely proves to be truly effective for large organizations or those
            requiring a high level of professionalism.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">In contrast, Mezon has been deployed internally at NCC with over 300 accounts,
            clearly demonstrating its superior effectiveness in community management, corporate culture building, and
            enhancing member engagement. Thanks to its three core pillars &ndash; Workstation, Ecosystem, and AI Agent
            &ndash; combined with strong automation capabilities, Mezon enables NCC to operate in a centralized,
            professional, and sustainable manner across the entire organization.</span></p>
    <p class="c4"><span class="c0">&#128073; While Discord is popular, it has not been proven effective for enterprise
            operations. Mezon, on the other hand, has been validated with real-world results, making it a trusted choice
            for organizations aiming to grow and build strong, engaged communities.</span></p>
    
